ion messages.\n\nI assume it because of `yii\\console\\controllers\\MessageController::generateMessageFile()` method generates only `msgid` and `msgstr` tags, while `yii\\i18n\\GettextPoFile::load()` expects `msgctxt` tag for translation category also (see [GettextPoFile.php#38](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/framework/i18n/GettextPoFile.php#L38)).\n\nP.S. `yii\\i18n\\GettextMoFile` doen't work also. I've compiled generated .po file with `pocompile` linux tool - Yii can't find any messages too ($separatorPosition is always false at [GettextMoFile.php#108](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/framework/i18n/GettextMoFile.php#L108))\n","closed_by":{"login":"samdark","id":47294,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3Mjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47294?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark","html_url":"https://github.com/samdark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samdark/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/4295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/4295/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}